---
// Karuzela przykładowych dań: przewijanie palcem na telefonie, strzałki na
// komputerze. Strzałki znikają, gdy wszystkie dania mieszczą się na ekranie.
import type { CmsDish } from '../../lib/datocms';

interface Props {
	dishes: CmsDish[];
}

const { dishes } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="carousel" role="group" aria-roledescription="karuzela" aria-label="Przykładowe dania">
	<ul class="track" tabindex="0">
		{
			dishes.map((dish) => (
				<li class="dish">
					<span class="photo-wrap">
						<img
							class="photo"
							src={`${dish.image.url}?w=640&h=480&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80`}
							srcset={`${dish.image.url}?w=400&h=300&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80 400w, ${dish.image.url}?w=640&h=480&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80 640w, ${dish.image.url}?w=960&h=720&fit=crop&auto=format&q=80 960w`}
							sizes="(max-width: 640px) 80vw, 24rem"
							alt={dish.image.alt ?? ''}
							width="640"
							height="480"
							loading="lazy"
						/>
					</span>
					<h3>{dish.title}</h3>
					{dish.description && <p>{dish.description}</p>}
				</li>
			))
		}
	</ul>
	<div class="arrows" hidden>
		<button type="button" class="arrow" data-dir="-1" aria-label="Poprzednie dania">
			<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5l-7 7 7 7"></path></svg>
		</button>
		<button type="button" class="arrow" data-dir="1" aria-label="Następne dania">
			<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
		</button>
	</div>
</div>

<script>
	document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.carousel').forEach((carousel) => {
		const track = carousel.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.track');
		const arrows = carousel.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.arrows');
		const buttons = carousel.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.arrow');
		if (!track || !arrows) return;

		const update = () => {
			const max = track.scrollWidth - track.clientWidth;
			arrows.hidden = max <= 1;
			buttons.forEach((button) => {
				button.disabled = button.dataset.dir === '-1' ? track.scrollLeft <= 1 : track.scrollLeft >= max - 1;
			});
		};

		buttons.forEach((button) => {
			button.addEventListener('click', () => {
				const card = track.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.dish');
				const gap = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(track).columnGap) || 0;
				const step = (card?.offsetWidth ?? track.clientWidth) + gap;
				track.scrollBy({ left: step * Number(button.dataset.dir), behavior: 'smooth' });
			});
		});

		track.addEventListener('scroll', update, { passive: true });
		new ResizeObserver(update).observe(track);
		update();
	});
</script>

<style>
	.track {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0 0 0.5rem;
		overflow-x: auto;
		overscroll-behavior-x: contain;
		scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
		scrollbar-width: none;
		list-style: none;
	}

	.track::-webkit-scrollbar {
		display: none;
	}

	.track:focus-visible {
		outline: 2px solid var(--color-energy);
		outline-offset: 4px;
	}

	/* trzy karty obok siebie, na telefonie jedna z widocznym brzegiem kolejnej */
	.dish {
		display: flex;
		flex: 0 0 calc((100% - 3rem) / 3);
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		min-width: min(17rem, 80%);
		padding: 2rem;
		overflow: hidden;
		background: var(--color-surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		border-top: 2px solid var(--color-energy);
		border-radius: var(--radius-button);
		scroll-snap-align: start;
	}

	/* zdjęcie od krawędzi do krawędzi, łagodny filtr marki — jak w pozostałych kartach */
	.photo-wrap {
		position: relative;
		display: block;
		margin: -2rem -2rem 0.5rem;
		isolation: isolate;
	}

	.photo-wrap::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: var(--tint-photo);
		mix-blend-mode: color;
		opacity: var(--tint-photo-soft-opacity);
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.photo {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
		object-fit: cover;
		filter: var(--filter-photo-soft);
	}

	h3 {
		font-size: 1.4rem;
	}

	p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
	}

	.arrows {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
	}

	.arrows[hidden] {
		display: none;
	}

	.arrow {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 44px;
		height: 44px;
		padding: 0;
		color: var(--btn-outline-color);
		background: transparent;
		border: var(--btn-outline-width) solid var(--btn-outline-color);
		border-radius: var(--radius-button);
		cursor: pointer;
		transition:
			background 0.2s ease,
			color 0.2s ease,
			opacity 0.2s ease;
	}

	.arrow:hover:not(:disabled) {
		color: var(--color-on-energy);
		background: var(--btn-outline-color);
	}

	.arrow:disabled {
		opacity: 0.35;
		cursor: default;
	}

	.arrow svg {
		width: 1.25rem;
		height: 1.25rem;
	}
</style>
